    },
    {
      "title": "Leo XIV, Trying to Be Everyone’s Pope, Tours Secular France",
      "link": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/25/world/europe/pope-leo-france-visit.html",
      "description": "After visiting Africa, Pope Leo’s four-day trip to France shows how he is seeking to appeal to Roman Catholicism’s original heartlands as well as to the church’s newest strongholds.",
